From: Fukui Daichi <a.dog.will.talk@akane.waseda.jp>
Last-Update: 2026-11-14
Subject: Use packaged bootstrap.bundle.min.js
 Load bootstrap.bundle.min.js from libjs-bootstrap5 (src:bootstrap-html)
 instead of the CDN. The integrity and crossorigin attributes are dropped
 because the SRI hash only matches the upstream CDN file.
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/1088499
Forwarded: not-needed

---
 pytest_mpl/summary/templates/base.html | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/pytest_mpl/summary/templates/base.html b/pytest_mpl/summary/templates/base.html
index 4ac3c66..ae81908 100644
--- a/pytest_mpl/summary/templates/base.html
+++ b/pytest_mpl/summary/templates/base.html
@@ -22,9 +22,7 @@
 </div>
 <div class="offcanvas offcanvas-start" tabindex="-1"></div>
 {% include 'filter.html' %}
